## Input

```css
$target: base;
%base { color: red; }
.target:not(.x) { color: red; }
.target[data-theme="dark"] { color: red; }

.media {
  @import "theme.css" screen and (min-width: 1px) /* media */
}
.modifiers {
  @import "theme.css" layer(theme) supports(display: grid) screen // media
}
.multiple {
  @import "one.css" /* first */, "two.css" /* last */
}
.pseudo { @extend :not(.x) /* target */ }
.attribute {
  @extend [data-theme="dark"] // target
}
.interpolation { @extend %#{$target}}
.after { width: 1px; }

```


